OL,3,GNEWSAIrish weather warning ahead of
OL,4,AStorm Austen
OL,5,
OL,6,FWeather warnings have been issued
OL,7,Facross the Republic of Ireland ahead of
OL,8,Fthe arrival of Storm Austen from the
OL,9,FAtlantic on Thursday.
OL,11,FThe storm is forecast to track to the
OL,12,Fsouth coast on Thursday evening into
OL,13,FFriday morning bringing the risk of
OL,14,Fflooding, travel disruption, and
OL,15,Fpotentially dangerous conditions.
OL,17,FWhile no warnings have been issued for
OL,18,FNorthern Ireland, Storm Austen is
OL,19,Fexpected to bring widespread rain on
OL,20,FThursday night, clearing east on Friday
OL,21,Fmorning.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
